									<div class="card-wrapper size1-1-fixed">
						<div class="cnf-block">
	<div class="cnf-block-image">
								<div class="cnf-block-badges">
								<span class="cnf-badge cnf-badge-white">Featured event</span>
							</div>
							<a href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-it/ai-digital-transformation-2026/2032" alt="AI &amp; Digital Transformation 2026">
			<img onerror="this.src='https://eventscdn.portfolio.hu/assets/images/missing.gif';" src="https://eventscdn.portfolio.hu/portfolio/conferences/p_ai_digital_transformation_2026_web_620x620-hu-2032-rz5r.jpg" alt="AI &amp; Digital Transformation 2026" loading="lazy">
			<img onerror="this.src='https://eventscdn.portfolio.hu/assets/images/missing.gif';" src="https://eventscdn.portfolio.hu/portfolio/conferences/p_ai_digital_transformation_2026_web_768x259-hu-2032-rnqq.jpg" alt="AI &amp; Digital Transformation 2026" loading="lazy">
		</a>
	</div>
	<div class="cnf-block-content" data-href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-it/ai-digital-transformation-2026/2032">
		<div>
								<div class="cnf-block-badges-wide mb-4">
								<span class="cnf-badge cnf-badge-white">Featured event</span>
							</div>
								<h2>
				<a href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-it/ai-digital-transformation-2026/2032">
					<span class="poppins weight-800 text-uppercase">AI &amp; Digital Transformation 2026</span>
					<div class="cnf-block-date mt-1">26th November 2026
						<span class="cnf-block-location">Marriott Hotel</span>
						<span class="cnf-block-city">Budapest</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</h2>
			<p class="cnf-block-lead lines-3">Our lives—and with them, the way companies operate—are becoming digitized at an astonishing pace; paper-based processes are disappearing, and we only visit branch offices for in-person transactions when dealing with the most complex matters; and we communicate and handle matters via digital channels 24/7. But now, the &nbsp;AI revolution and the agentic AI trend are turning the digital world, internal operations, and customer-facing front-ends upside down. AI agents capable of acting autonomously, as well as AI tools and enterprise solutions that support specific business, compliance, and administrative processes, offer companies previously unimaginable speed and extraordinary potential for efficiency gains. What do we do with the hours of work we’ve gained and the labor we’ve saved? Is artificial intelligence disrupting core business as well? What is vibe coding good for? At our event for both large corporations and SMEs, we’ll be seeking and providing answers to these questions and more!

&nbsp;</p>
		</div>

