				<a href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-agricultural/agricultural-conference-2026/1990">
					<span class="poppins weight-800 text-uppercase">Agricultural Conference 2026</span>
					<div class="cnf-block-date mt-1">2nd–3rd December 2026
						<span class="cnf-block-location">Siófok, Hotel Azúr Wellness ****</span>
