	<div class="cnf-block-content" data-href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-property/property-warm-up-2027/2140">
		<div>
										<h2>
				<a href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-property/property-warm-up-2027/2140">
					<span class="poppins weight-800 text-uppercase">Property Warm Up 2027</span>
					<div class="cnf-block-date mt-1">23rd February 2027
						<span class="cnf-block-location">Crowne Plaza Budapest</span>
						<span class="cnf-block-city">Budapest</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</h2>
			<p class="cnf-block-lead lines-3">The Hungarian real estate market's special start-of-year professional, business and networking event, to start the year from an even broader perspective!&nbsp;We feel the soaring or pressured processes, phenomena, challenges and opportunities of the real estate market on a daily basis, but to discuss, to discuss, to exchange personal opinions and to cultivate real business opportunities and relationships is always the most useful way of common development.

At the beginning of the year, however, we would like - in addition to the&nbsp;inevitable meeting, exchange of information and business/friendship networking&nbsp;- to have the opportunity to discuss, hear presentations and hear talks on wider topics that indirectly affect the world of real estate, but which do have a strong impact. Such key areas include the macro-economic and financing situation, foresight, climate change, social change, understanding future generations, global financial and energy market expectations, or the most important issues affecting the future of the world economy and society, i.e. our future, the future of our partners, tenants and employees.

Let's kick off what promises to be a difficult but positive and optimistic year with a special real estate kick-off meeting!

The themes that are transforming our world and our immediate environment and the event's headline sponsor is Gránit Pólus.</p>
		</div>

