	</div>
	<div class="cnf-block-content" data-href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-finance/insurance-2026/2188">
		<div>
										<h2>
				<a href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-finance/insurance-2026/2188">
					<span class="poppins weight-800 text-uppercase">Insurance 2026</span>
					<div class="cnf-block-date mt-1">18th March 2027
						<span class="cnf-block-location">Hotel InterContinental Budapest</span>
						<span class="cnf-block-city">Budapest</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</h2>
			<p class="cnf-block-lead lines-3">In 2027, players in the Hungarian insurance market will face both new risks and new opportunities for growth. The Portfolio Insurance 2027 conference will focus on how new growth areas in the domestic health insurance market are taking shape, what directions the new government and the central bank may set for the insurance and savings markets, and what business and strategic outlooksinsurance sector leaders anticipate.

The conference’s panel discussions will provide a comprehensive assessment of the challenges facing the market, current regulatory and sales issues, and the most important questions concerning life, property, and liability insurance.
The conference will focus not only on domestic developments but also on the international outlook: it will cover the career paths of Hungarian professionals in Europe and the market challenges observed in countries to the west of Hungary. Another key topic will be the role of AI in the insurance market: what the technology promises in terms of sales, operations, and customer service, and what risks and threats it entails.

True to Portfolio’s traditions, the event is an important meeting place for insurers, brokers, consultants, and technology providers, where networking plays a central role alongside professional content.
The Portfolio Insurance 2027 conference, a major gathering of Hungarian insurers and brokers, will take place on March 18—it’s definitely worth attending!

&nbsp;</p>
		</div>

