	<div class="cnf-block-content" data-href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-property/construction-industry-2027/2172">
		<div>
										<h2>
				<a href="https://www.portfolio.hu/en/events/conference-property/construction-industry-2027/2172">
					<span class="poppins weight-800 text-uppercase">Construction Industry 2027</span>
					<div class="cnf-block-date mt-1">23rd March 2027
						<span class="cnf-block-location">Hotel InterContinental Budapest</span>
						<span class="cnf-block-city">Budapest</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</h2>
			<p class="cnf-block-lead lines-3">The industry’s top professionals are coming together again! Our “Portfolio Construction Industry” conference has grown into perhaps the most important business gathering in the Hungarian construction industry, which we will be hosting for the ninth time in 2027 with the participation and support of the industry’s leading figures. At the event, we’ll explore the most pressing and current financial, business, regulatory, and efficiency issues affecting the construction industry alongside the industry’s thought leaders. The “Portfolio Construction Industry 2027” conference is not only a full-day professional and thought-leader forum, but also one of the most effective business networking venues for industry players, where, in addition to a presentation on the future of the market, we also offer a full day of premium networking opportunities and a casual evening reception for participants.

In addition to professional and content-based appearances in the conference program, we offer our partners the opportunity to showcase themselves to the more than 500 leading construction industry professionals attending the event—whether through an experiential and/or product-presentation-oriented space, booths, or services.

Let’s continue to build the domestic construction industry together in these new times!

Be there at the awards ceremony! Join us for the event following the conference, featuring a reception, networking, bars, and informal professional discussions. Let’s celebrate the domestic construction industry together!</p>
